00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,530
The Southern Domain of Allheaven

22
00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:09,920
is a wasteland.

23
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,090
Most planets here are abandoned

24
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,450
with very little spiritual energy.

25
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:16,160
That's why strong cultivators aren't willing to set foot here.

26
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,280
Instead, it has become a sanctuary for mortals

27
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,730
and low-level cultivation families.

28
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:21,520
Perfect.

29
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,480
This place is secluded enough.

30
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:26,000
I still have 20 years before

31
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,160
the Thunder Celestial Realm opens.

32
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,640
During this time, I have 2 important things to do.

33
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:30,920
The first one

34
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,400
is to adjust my spells

35
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:35,690
that don't align with the third step I saw.

36
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:37,320
That way, I won't walk the wrong path.

37
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,120
The second one

38
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,800
is to gather resentment

39
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,280
for the Underworld River.

40
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,160
Damn sword intent,

41
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,680
Grandpa Xu has finally conquered you !

42
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,800
From now on,

43
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,000
I am the true Sword Spirit !

44
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,400
Little Lin,

45
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:58,520
are you still not letting me out ?

46
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,170
Noisy...

47
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,760
Just you wait...

48
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,040
We're not done yet !

49
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,320
The aura of this planet

50
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,650
Planet Qing Lin
Southern Domain
Allheaven Star System

51
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,880
is similar to Planet Suzaku.

52
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,880
This planet has many mortals

53
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,880
and its strongest cultivator is only Nascent Soul.

54
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,360
There's not a single Soul Formation cultivator.

55
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:22,440
Many cultivation families depend on mortal kingdoms to survive.

56
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,480
Because the spiritual energy is scarce,

57
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,240
it's difficult for them to grow.

58
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,320
This is exactly what I need.

59
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,360
Father,

60
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,440
slow down.

61
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:46,490
Zhang Yang
Young Master of the Zhang Family
Early stage Nascent Soul

62
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:46,490
Zhang Xinhai
Zhang Family Head
Late stage Nascent Soul

63
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,520
Your father

64
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,680
has little time left.

65
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,880
The Zhang Family Head of every generation

66
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:55,680
must personally set foot on this peak

67
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,250
to gaze upon the heavens and the earth

68
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,840
and try to understand them.

69
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,480
This is the ancestral rule.

70
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:07,280
Looking back, I, Zhang Xinhai,

71
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:10,360
have led the Zhang Family for centuries.

72
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,840
The Zhang Family

73
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:16,320
has become the number one family on this planet.

74
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:21,050
The previous Zhang Family Heads were also diligent

75
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,480
so why

76
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:26,130
don't the heavens let us live longer ?

77
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,800
In the end,

78
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:31,520
I was stuck at Late stage Nascent Soul

79
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,880
unable to reach Soul Formation.

80
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:36,160
What a pity...

81
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,720
Father...

82
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,240
This person...

83
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,280
I wasn't able to see him

84
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,080
when I used my Divine Sense earlier

85
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:04,000
but I can clearly see him with my eyes.

86
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,640
What level of cultivation is this ?

87
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,240
This place

88
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,640
is not bad.

89
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,080
What a pity

90
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,160
that such a peak

91
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:17,080
is being used by you guys as a graveyard.

92
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:35,720
Junior Zhang Xinhai pays respects to Senior.

93
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:39,080
If Senior likes this Heng Yun Peak,

94
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:41,640
Junior will offer it to you immediately.

95
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,090
Your lifespan is nearly exhausted.

96
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,040
Even with my power,

97
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,760
it's hard to solve.

98
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,440
Senior misunderstood me.

99
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:57,680
Junior understands the will of the heavens.

100
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,480
Before I die,

101
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,880
I would like to have the tremendous opportunity

102
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:04,360
to witness Senior's spells.

103
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,960
That way, I'll die without regrets.

104
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,880
Not to mention this peak,

105
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,840
I'll even gift you

106
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,400
Planet Qing Lin

107
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:15,000
if Senior likes it.

108
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,560
I can't defy the heavens

109
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,240
to change your fate.

110
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,880
But I can ignite your remaining spiritual energy

111
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,560
to extend your lifespan

112
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:25,080
by 10 years.

113
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:32,160
I can barely perform this spell

114
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,280
after seeing the third step.

115
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,530
If I had known this option existed back then,

116
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,040
Wan'er wouldn't be like this...

117
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,280
Thank you, Senior, for giving me a second life.

118
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,960
Thank you, Senior !

119
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,280
Senior, what are your instructions ?

120
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,640
The entire Zhang Family

121
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,880
will do its best

122
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,440
to carry them out.

123
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,880
I give you 10 years

124
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,240
to gather

125
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,480
as much resentment from mortals as possible.

126
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,520
The more the better.

127
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,680
If I’m pleased with your result,

128
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:18,880
then

129
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,880
as long as I'm on this planet,

130
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,960
your Zhang Family

131
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:24,160
will never lose its legacy.

132
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:30,960
Father,

133
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,680
who is this person ?

134
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,240
Don't ask too much !

135
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,290
Quick,

136
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,210
let's return to the family.

137
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,480
Mobilize the whole family

138
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,000
no matter the cost

139
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,400
to work for Senior.

140
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,920
This is the Zhang Family's

141
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,080
heaven-sent fortune !

142
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,920
From today onward,

143
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,880
this planet

144
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,440
belongs to me.

145
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:15,320
The area 10 000 li from Heng Yun Peak

146
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,880
is now a restricted area.

147
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,890
Intruders

148
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,960
will not be shown mercy.

149
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:40,160
On this day,

150
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,640
I became the ruler of Planet Qing Ling.

151
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,880
The restricted area of Heng Yun:

152
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,680
10 000 li sealed off.

153
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,640
The Soul Lasher...

154
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,680
I have many artifacts.

155
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,160
In terms of offense,

156
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:03,010
the celestial sword and the half-moon blade are stronger.

157
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:04,880
In terms of defense,

158
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:08,370
the Billion-Soul Flag and the Mountains and Rivers Painting are sturdier.

159
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,840
In terms of abilities,

160
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:12,880
the Celestial Mountain and the God Slaying Chariot are more versatile.

161
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,840
But this whip

162
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:19,240
is the only one that faintly touches upon the third step I glimpsed at.

163
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,880
It subtly aligns with the meaning of karma.

164
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,520
My domain

165
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,800
has gradually shifted from Life and Death toward Karma.

166
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,280
But this path is vast

167
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,640
and with my current comprehension

168
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:35,640
I'm not yet able to materialize it.

169
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,880
I can probably use this whip to carry my domain

170
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:43,720
and slowly materialize it.

171
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,600
Merging my domain and an artifact...

172
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,530
The Dao is within oneself.

173
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,120
I'll use this whip as a proxy,

174
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,840
to temporarily carry karma.

175
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,480
I hope

176
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:59,960
it will not betray my Dao.

177
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:23,010
5 years later

178
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,610
Zhang Family Residence
Planet Qing Lin

179
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:25,170
Family Head,

180
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,370
70% of the resentment from the West Mountains Region has been gathered.

181
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,320
But the land is vast

182
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,280
and mortals are scattered.

183
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,010
It will be difficult to accelerate.

184
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,690
The situation on the eastern sea islands is even worse.

185
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,640
Although there are numerous islanders,

186
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,780
travel time is the issue.

187
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,230
Flying all over the place

188
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,440
takes a lot of time.

189
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,370
Faster !

190
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,800
You must do it faster !

191
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,880
Half of the 10 years deadline has passed

192
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:45,440
and we have gathered less than 40%.

193
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,880
Senior's order

194
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:49,760
will determine the future of our Zhang Family !

195
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,600
Issue the order,

196
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,080
all family members

197
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,720
must spare no cost

198
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,800
and work day and night

199
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:59,480
in order to complete Senior's order !

200
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,280
Understood !

201
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,920
A dead end ?

202
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,920
Nothing but dead ends !

203
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,160
We

204
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:23,480
have stumbled into the Heng Yun restricted area.

205
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,000
Don't...

206
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,600
Don't scare yourself.

207
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:28,800
Maybe...

208
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,040
Maybe...

209
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,760
it's just some mountain fog.

210
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,200
You don't know how

211
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,920
the Nascent Soul Ancestors from the Li Family of West City

212
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,600
met their end ?

213
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,520
Where did this outsider come from ?

214
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:45,520
Who dares to claim Planet Qing Lin ?

215
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,800
Break for me !

216
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,920
Even Nascent Soul Ancestors

217
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:56,640
were crushed like bugs.

218
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,760
And we, two mortals,

219
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,160
won't even fill the gaps in those ghost's teeths...

220
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:10,640
Ancestor, spare us !

221
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:11,960
We didn't mean to intrude.

222
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,320
We...

223
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,400
are not dead ?

224
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,120
Thank you, Ancestor, for sparing our lives !

225
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,280
Thank you, Ancestor, for sparing our lives !

226
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,440
Thank you for your mercy, Ancestor !

227
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,320
Ancestor is kind !

228
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,880
After 5 years of refining,

229
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,840
the domain started merging.

230
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,760
Using this whip to wield karma

231
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:38,970
Karma Whip

232
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,440
is more convenient

233
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,080
than using Divine Sense to control my domain.

234
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,240
It should be twice as strong now.

235
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:42,800
However,

236
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:45,320
I still need to test it.

237
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:46,920
Little Lin,

238
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,160
stop fiddling with that little broken whip.

239
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,080
Your Grandpa Xu

240
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,840
now carries ancient sword intent.

241
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,480
Come out.

242
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,480
You still dare speak to Grandpa Xu like that ?

243
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,440
Little Lin,

244
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,720
you still haven't grasped the situation.

245
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:06,040
I'm not the same Xu Liguo from back then anymore !

246
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,840
What the hell is this thing !?

247
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,000
Every being in this world

248
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,600
is subject to karma.

249
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:16,940
There is no place

250
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,120
without karmic causes.

251
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:20,020
And karmic effects

252
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,920
are everywhere.

253
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:25,280
The karmic effect is also the source of the karmic cause.

254
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,360
Master, have mercy !

255
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:33,960
I'm dissipating !

256
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,790
I'm really

257
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:36,160
going to dissipate !

258
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,880
You obtained your ancient sword intent

259
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,880
thanks to me.

260
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,880
The resulting karmic effect

261
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:47,360
belongs to me as well.

262
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,680
Little Xu knows he was wrong !

263
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,960
I was truly wrong...

264
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,800
Besides,

265
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,240
if it weren't for Master

266
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,400
refining me into a devil back then,

267
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,320
how could I be where I am today ?

268
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,770
No, no, no...

269
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,480
I meant...

270
00:13:57,520 --> 00:14:00,280
How could I have the fortune to stay by Master's side ?

271
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,800
That is your karma,

272
00:14:01,920 --> 00:14:03,200
not mine.

273
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:06,640
Xu Liguo, you idiot !

274
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,040
Why do you always forget

275
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:10,480
that the fiend is more of a devil than me...

276
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,240
Master !

277
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:13,840
Master, have mercy !

278
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,120
Little Xu knows he was wrong !

279
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,160
I'm really sorry !

280
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:17,760
This is not a joke !

281
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:29,200
It's decently strong.

282
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,240
Master's skills are unparalleled !

283
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,160
Just now,

284
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:37,440
Little Xu was just putting on an act

285
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:40,360
